      <h3 id="api-compatibility-common-terminology-virtualized_compatibility-guidelines" class="group scroll-mt-20">Compatibility in a virtualized environment<a href="#api-compatibility-common-terminology-virtualized_compatibility-guidelines" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
